insert into public.work_editorials (work_id,locale,short_summary,why_it_matters,historical_context,key_innovation,editorial_notes,verification_status,reviewed_at) select id,'ja','通常のカメラを用いず、レーザーとセンサーのデータによってThom Yorke、複数の顔、郊外空間を不安定な点群として再構成した作品。','取得データを映像の素材であると同時に公開可能な資料として扱い、MVをインタラクティブビューアと公開コードへ接続しました。','James Frostが監督し2008年に公開。Radioheadの『In Rainbows』期とオープンソースのデータプロジェクトを結び、2009年GRAMMY Best Music Videoにノミネートされました。','構造化光による顔の取得、回転式LIDAR、点群レンダリング、公開データセットによって、写真表面を測定された空間サンプルへ置き換えています。','Acquisition reason: Representative work for Scan Data.','verified',now() from public.works where slug='radiohead-house-of-cards' on conflict (work_id,locale) do update set short_summary=excluded.short_summary,why_it_matters=excluded.why_it_matters,historical_context=excluded.historical_context,key_innovation=excluded.key_innovation,editorial_notes=excluded.editorial_notes,verification_status='verified',reviewed_at=excluded.reviewed_at;
insert into public.work_editorials (work_id,locale,short_summary,why_it_matters,historical_context,key_innovation,editorial_notes,verification_status,reviewed_at) select id,'en','Laser and sensor data reconstruct Thom Yorke, other faces, and suburban spaces as unstable clouds of measured points without conventional cameras.','The project treated capture data as both the source image and a public material, linking a music video to an interactive viewer and released code.','Directed by James Frost and released in 2008, the work joined Radiohead''s In Rainbows period to an open-source data project and received a 2009 GRAMMY nomination for Best Music Video.','Structured-light face capture, rotating LIDAR scans, point-cloud rendering, and released datasets replace photographic surfaces with measurable spatial samples.','Acquisition reason: Representative work for Scan Data.','verified',now() from public.works where slug='radiohead-house-of-cards' on conflict (work_id,locale) do update set short_summary=excluded.short_summary,why_it_matters=excluded.why_it_matters,historical_context=excluded.historical_context,key_innovation=excluded.key_innovation,editorial_notes=excluded.editorial_notes,verification_status='verified',reviewed_at=excluded.reviewed_at;
