insert into public.work_editorials (work_id,locale,short_summary,why_it_matters,historical_context,key_innovation,editorial_notes,verification_status,reviewed_at) select id,'ja','飛行機に乗ろうとするビジネストラベラーの移動が、倒れる身体、医療危機、航空事故、曖昧な帰還の反復へ変わっていく作品。','楽曲の『身を委ねる』という主題に身体的な物語を与え、不安、反復、不可能な生還を現実と幻覚の間で往復させました。','『Currents』期の2015年に公開され、David Wilsonが監督、Colonel Blimpが制作。UKMVAのBest Rock/Indie Video — Internationalを受賞しました。','ありふれた空港移動を、倒れる身体、停止した時間、VFXによる転換、単一の文字通りの解釈を拒む物語ループによって段階的に不安定化しています。','Acquisition reason: Candidate representative work for Editing / Loop.','verified',now() from public.works where slug='tame-impala-let-it-happen' on conflict (work_id,locale) do update set short_summary=excluded.short_summary,why_it_matters=excluded.why_it_matters,historical_context=excluded.historical_context,key_innovation=excluded.key_innovation,editorial_notes=excluded.editorial_notes,verification_status='verified',reviewed_at=excluded.reviewed_at;
insert into public.work_editorials (work_id,locale,short_summary,why_it_matters,historical_context,key_innovation,editorial_notes,verification_status,reviewed_at) select id,'en','A business traveller''s attempt to reach a flight turns into collapse, medical crisis, aerial disaster, and a sequence of ambiguous returns.','The video gives the song''s theme of surrender a bodily narrative, allowing anxiety, repetition, and impossible survival to move between realism and hallucination.','Released in 2015 during the Currents period, the video was directed by David Wilson, produced by Colonel Blimp, and won the UKMVA category for Best Rock/Indie Video — International.','A familiar airport journey is progressively destabilized through repeated collapse, suspended time, visual-effects transitions, and narrative loops that refuse a single literal explanation.','Acquisition reason: Candidate representative work for Editing / Loop.','verified',now() from public.works where slug='tame-impala-let-it-happen' on conflict (work_id,locale) do update set short_summary=excluded.short_summary,why_it_matters=excluded.why_it_matters,historical_context=excluded.historical_context,key_innovation=excluded.key_innovation,editorial_notes=excluded.editorial_notes,verification_status='verified',reviewed_at=excluded.reviewed_at;
